<section>
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="reveal-left">
      <p class="lead">TSA is a national Career and Technical Student Organization of middle and high school students who compete in events across science, public speaking, engineering, technology, mathematics, and more — helping members find their passions for the future.</p>
      <p>Every year, chapters like ours take part in a full slate of competitive events that cover almost every corner of STEM. For the 2026–2027 year, TSA is offering <strong>42 high school events</strong>, ranging from coding and engineering design to debate, video production, and biotechnology — there is genuinely something for every interest.</p>
      <p>Through ideating, community service, teamwork, and problem solving, our motto is simple:</p>
      <p class="pull-quote">"Learning to Lead in a Technical World."</p>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="events.html#event-explorer">Explore this year's events →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal-right">
